<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 6.0 pct in year to April.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 6.0 pct in year to April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   April		March</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	  +0.2%		+0.5%</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	    +6.0%		+6.5%</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted)	+0.9%		+1.9%</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	  +5.1%		+7.1%</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 6.4 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
</text>
